PER-TENSOR DROP_DOWNPROJ LAYER PROJECTION (Mistral-7B, batch N=8192, bf16, full clock):
- fused per-tensor FP8 GEMM (scalar->bf16, no epilogue): q 1.77x, k 1.89x, v 1.89x, o 1.81x, gate 2.05x, up 1.91x, down 1.98x vs bf16
- layer drop_downproj (q,k,v,o,gate,up=fp8; down=bf16): 1.28x over bf16 with NAIVE act-quant (conservative); ~1.4-1.5x with optimized fused act-quant
